<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS3" title="In 5 Experiments ‣ AgenTracer: Who Is Inducing Failure in the LLM Agentic Systems?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.3 </span>Boosting Mainstream MAS</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS4" title="In 5 Experiments ‣ AgenTracer: Who Is Inducing Failure in the LLM Agentic Systems?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.4 </span>Case Study</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In AgenTracer: Who Is Inducing Failure in the LLM Agentic Systems?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
