<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><img src="2509.03312v1/fig/logo.png" id="g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:28/28;" width="28" height="28" alt="[Uncaptioned image]">AgenTracer: Who Is Inducing Failure in the LLM Agentic Systems?</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Guibin Zhang
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_email"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Email: </span><a href="mailto:wang.kun@ntu.edu.sg">wang.kun@ntu.edu.sg</a>
</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Junhao Wang
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_email"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Email: </span><a href="mailto:yansc@comp.nus.edu.sg">yansc@comp.nus.edu.sg</a>
</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Junjie Chen
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
