<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 3: </span>The multi-turn improvement performance brought by <span id="S5.F3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold">AgenTracer<span id="S5.F3.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">-8B</span></span> compared with classical agent reflection baselines, Self-Refine, and CRITIC.</figcaption>
